    "title": "Word Search - Word Puzzle Game",
    "description": "Take your mind on an exotic journey with the most exciting, destination-themed free word search! \ud83c\udf0e\r\n\r\nTravel the world with Word Search Journey, a beautiful word puzzle game with all the challenging yet entertaining word hunt features you love! Train & exercise your brain in a fun, relaxing way and stretch your critical thinking skills and IQ to a new level.\r\n\r\n\u2b50 <b>SPECIAL FEATURES</b> \u2b50\r\n\u2666 CHALLENGE YOUR MIND: These word find games are easy at first, but they get challenging fast. Is your mind ready to get pushed to the next level with word puzzles?\r\n\u2666 INCREASING DIFFICULTY: Work your way up 4 levels: Easy, Medium, Hard, and Pro!\r\n\u2666 NO WIFI REQUIRED: This offline word puzzle doesn\u2019t require wifi, which means you can play with anyone anywhere!\r\n\u2666 CREATED FOR ALL AGES: The perfect crossword game for kids, adults, and even your grandma!\r\n\u2666 REDUCE STRESS: Word puzzles combined with breathtaking landscapes create a relaxing wordscapes search\r\n\u2666 100% FREE: Download and play this word search free!\r\n\r\n\u2600\ufe0f <b>HOW TO PLAY</b> \u2600\ufe0f\r\n\u2666 IT\u2019S EASY: Search for words by swiping up, down, left, right, or diagonally in infinite word search games\r\n\u2666 EXPLORE UNIQUE LEVELS: Choose from a variety of themes featuring new destinations from around the globe, in addition to classic categories from your favorite word search games\r\n\u2666 DESTRESS: Unwind after a long day at work with calming, zen crosswords. Word Search Journey is an amazing mental getaway if you\u2019re up for the challenge!\r\n\u2666 EXPAND YOUR VOCABULARY: With each level, your vocabulary will level up and prepare you for the next exotic word puzzle!\r\n\r\nWe promise you\u2019ll leave each game feeling accomplished, smarter, and more at peace! Word Search Journey is satisfying, challenging, and the perfect new twist of a classic word search game and a world exploration you won\u2019t want to put down!\r\n\r\nGot your passport ready? \ud83c\udfab Download Word Search Journey, the best free word puzzle game and start your crossword exploration of the world!",
